  "description": "Upgrade your Toyota Tundra with OEDRO's high-performance drop running boards. Designed for the 2022-2026 CrewMax Cab, these running boards not only enhance the look of your truck but also provide superior protection. Featuring a robust three-tube design, they shield the underbody and sides from potential damage while ensuring clearance from obstacles. Whether you're navigating rough terrain or just want easy access to your truck, these running boards deliver style and functionality in one package.\nFeatures\n6-Inch Side Pedals: The dual-level design accommodates lifted vehicles with oversized tires, offering easier access and better convenience.\nThree-Tube Design: Extra protection for the vehicle’s underside and sides, preventing damage from rocks, debris, and other obstacles.\nBolt-Fixed Installation: No cutting or drilling required—welded brackets provide a secure, sturdy fit.\nDurable & Weatherproof: Anti-rust powder coating ensures long-lasting durability, making these running boards ideal for all driving conditions.\nEnhanced Grip & Safety: Laser-cut treads offer an anti-skid surface for added safety, even in wet or muddy conditions.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2022-2026 Toyota Tundra Crewmax Cab.\nNot fit to power-deploying running boards（Platinum / TRD Pro Trims Optional）.",
